    "whatToDo": "Connect customer service to product. Pull the last 90 days of customer requests, complaints and \"do you also do this\" questions out of your CS team and find the thing your best customers keep asking for that you do not sell. Build that as your second product. Start small, test it with your best customers first, keep the quality high, and price it higher than your first product. Keep the first product running smoothly the whole time you build it.",
