    "whatToDo": "Install an incremental product improvement process, one written process that both products run through. The steps the guide gives are: find what is not working, figure out why, create a better way, test it, train people on it, then monitor the results. Work on one improvement per product at a time instead of a long list, and write down the number that proves it worked. Document the new way so the change sticks after everyone moves on.",
